easter        | Good Friday                                   | -2 | public          |  |  |  |
decree        | Hari Raya Puasa                               | 2024-4-10 2025-3-31 | public          |  |  |  |
fixed         | Labour Day                                    | 5 1 | public          |  |  |  |
decree        | Vesak Day                                     | 2024-5-22 2025-5-12 | public          |  |  |  |
decree        | Hari Raya Haji                                | 2024-6-17 2025-6-7 | public          |  |  |  |
fixed         | National Day                                  | 8 9 | public          |  |  |  |
decree        | Deepavali                                     | 2024-10-31 2025-10-20 | public          |  |  |  |
fixed         | Christmas Day                                 | 12 25 | public          |  |  |  |
